-antonelli-and-russell-during-second-practice.2CeFTkESJX45t8tlF1V0rm), which left him 0.092s clear of Antonelli and a further tenth faster than Russell at the Suzuka Circuit.\n\nLando Norris was half a second away from his team mate but the reigning World Champion missed the first half of the one-hour session as McLaren investigated a hydraulic leak, with the top six completed by Ferrari's Charles Leclerc and Lewis Hamilton.\n\nTo watch all the highlights from Free Practice 2, click on the video player above."}},{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"eqwtu802quzt"}},"id":"2CegvG8US0CCOgIUYiC6UG","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2018-09-03T10:52:17.269Z","updatedAt":"2023-03-08T05:27:06.629Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":13,"revision":3,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"tag"}},"locale":"en"},"fields":{"tagName":"Highlights","slug":"highlights","tagGroup":"Content - Subject","tagImage":[{"url":"https://media.formula1.com/image/upload/content/dam/fom-website/2018-redesign-assets/Tag%20collections/Other/highlights.jpg","format":"jpg","metadata":{"alt_text":"highlights.jpg","caption":"highlights.jpg"},"public_id":"content/dam/fom-website/2018-redesign-assets/Tag%20collections/Other/highlights","secure_url":"https://media.formula1.com/image/upload/content/dam/fom-website/2018-redesign-assets/Tag%20collections/Other/highlights.jpg","resource_type":"image","raw_transformation":"f_auto/q_auto","original_secure_url":"https://media.formula1.com/image/upload/content/dam/fom-website/2018-redesign-assets/Tag%20collections/Other/highlights.jpg"}]}},{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"eqwtu802quzt"}},"id":"2s8G42lTNSea2UaAueW8MG","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2018-04-24T16:59:06.282Z","updatedAt":"2018-06-28T08:54:49.062Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"L